          {
            "title": "Question: Any number",
            "id": 73310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa jumlah maksimum nilai yang dapat ditampung sebuah array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebanyak yang kita mau</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebanyak yang kita mau.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Array playlist bertambah dari 3 lagu menjadi 12 lagu. Bisakah array yang sama menampung semua 12 lagu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ya, array dapat menampung nilai sebanyak yang kita butuhkan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak, array hanya dapat menampung satu nilai</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak, array berhenti menerima nilai setelah nilai kesepuluh</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ya, tetapi hanya setelah mengganti tiga lagu awal</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ya, array dapat menampung nilai sebanyak yang kita butuhkan.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element",
            "id": 73903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa itu elemen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nilai dalam array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebuah array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kondisi sebuah array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nilai dalam array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam <code>const scores = [8, 10, 9]</code>, pilihan mana yang merupakan elemen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nilai <code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Seluruh array <code>[8, 10, 9]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Indeks yang digunakan untuk menemukan <code>10</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nama variabel <code>scores</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Nilai <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Value in an array",
            "id": 73269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tetapkan array dengan nilai <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> ke variabel <code>toDo</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Feed Clawdius&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;To Do:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Feed Darian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"To Do:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[ 'Feed Clawdius' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 73271,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat array yang menyimpan <code>\"classic\"</code> dan <code>\"dark mode\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat array yang menyimpan <code>\"classic\"</code> dan <code>\"dark mode\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"theme\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"styles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"modes\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>themes</code>, diikuti oleh <code>[</code>, dan terakhir <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Empty array",
            "id": 73313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ shoppingList ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bayangkan kamu menambahkan <code>\"milk\"</code> dengan <code>.push()</code> sebelum mencatat array ini. Apa yang ditampilkan konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[ \"milk\" ]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\", \"milk\" ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[ \"milk\" ]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Start at zero",
            "id": 73926,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa indeks <code>\"lightBlue\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ekspresi mana yang mengambil <code>\"lightBlue\"</code> dari <code>colorScheme</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colorScheme[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[-1]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme(0)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>colorScheme[0]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Change value",
            "id": 73974,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perbarui elemen kedua menjadi <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" missedCalls = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lou&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Zoe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"missedCalls[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(missedCalls);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"missedCalls[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Robert&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Lou', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>missedCalls[1]</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Valid index",
            "id": 73931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa indeks terakhir yang bisa kita akses dalam array ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Array memiliki tiga nilai pengiriman dan indeks dimulai dari <code>0</code>. Indeks terakhir mana yang valid?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code>, indeks nilai ketiga</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, karena array memiliki tiga nilai</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, karena nilai terakhir adalah <code>true</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>, karena hanya nilai <code>false</code> yang dihitung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>, indeks nilai ketiga.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Start at zero",
            "id": 73980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tempatkan <code>\"Meg\"</code> pada indeks <code>0</code> dan <code>\"Max\"</code> pada indeks <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Meg\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tempatkan <code>\"Meg\"</code> pada indeks <code>0</code> dan <code>\"Max\"</code> pada indeks <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"shift\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Meg\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 73925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara mengakses nilai <code>22</code> dalam array ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>bingoAnswer[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai <code>22</code> berada di urutan ketiga dalam <code>bingoAnswer</code>. Ekspresi mana yang mengambilnya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[22]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>bingoAnswer[2]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 74092,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menghapus nilai terakhir dari sebuah array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini menghapus nilai pertama dari array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ini menghapus nilai acak dari sebuah array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menghapus nilai terakhir dari sebuah array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu memanggil <code>tasks.pop()</code> pada <code>[\"email\", \"call\", \"meeting\"]</code>. Apa yang terjadi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Method menghapus dan mengembalikan <code>\"meeting\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Method menghapus dan mengembalikan <code>\"email\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Method menghapus salah satu dari tiga tugas secara acak</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Method mengembalikan <code>3</code> dan mempertahankan ketiga tugas</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Method menghapus dan mengembalikan <code>\"meeting\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 74095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa fungsi <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menambahkan nilai ke array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini menghapus nilai dari array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ini membuat sebuah array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menambahkan nilai ke array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah <code>forecast.push(\"windy\")</code>, apa yang terjadi pada <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Array menjadi <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Array menjadi <code>[\"sunny\", \"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Method membuat array <code>[\"windy\"]</code> terpisah</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Array menjadi <code>[\"windy\", \"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Array menjadi <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 74090,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan <code>\"windy\"</code> ke array prakiraan cuaca ini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(forecast);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sunny', 'cloudy', 'windy' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>forecast</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>push</code>, <code>\"windy\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 74094,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa indeks <code>\"salami\"</code> dalam array setelah menambahkannya dengan <code>push()</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah <code>push()</code> yang ditampilkan, indeks mana yang mengambil <code>\"salami\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>toppings.push[1]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 74091,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa nilai <code>digit</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorCode = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" digit = doorCode.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(digit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah <code>pop()</code> yang ditampilkan, hasil mana yang menjelaskan <code>digit</code> dan <code>doorCode</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorCode = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" digit = doorCode.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(digit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">digit bernilai 1 dan doorCode adalah [2, 5, 0, 0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">digit bernilai 1 dan doorCode adalah [2, 5, 0, 0, 1]</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">digit bernilai 1 dan doorCode adalah [5, 0, 0, 1]</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">digit bernilai 0 dan doorCode adalah [2, 5, 0, 1]</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">digit bernilai 1 dan doorCode adalah [2, 5, 0, 0].</p></body></html>",
