            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang akan ditampilkan cuplikan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" family = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frank&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monica&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiona&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lip&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(family.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"6\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah kedua pemanggilan <code>pop()</code>, nama mana yang tersisa dan panjang berapa yang ditampilkan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" family = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frank&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monica&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiona&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lip&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(family.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Frank dan Monica tersisa, lalu <code>2</code> ditampilkan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Frank, Monica, dan Fiona tersisa, lalu <code>3</code> ditampilkan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Keempat nama tersisa, lalu <code>4</code> ditampilkan</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Fiona dan Lip tersisa, lalu <code>2</code> ditampilkan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Frank dan Monica tersisa, lalu <code>2</code> ditampilkan.</p></body></html>"
